WEBVTT

00:03:28.913 --> 00:03:32.875
They went to the Billboard charts
to look at who was at the top.

00:03:33.376 --> 00:03:36.462
They went to album sales
to see who was selling,

00:03:36.462 --> 00:03:38.631
who the public really loved.

00:03:39.465 --> 00:03:42.927
They looked at lists
that experts had put together.

00:03:42.927 --> 00:03:45.054
Who's at the top?
Who's really going to win?

00:03:45.054 --> 00:03:46.264
Who has longevity?

00:03:47.348 --> 00:03:50.393
Well, I didn't really understand
any of that data.

00:03:50.393 --> 00:03:51.394
(Laughs)

00:03:51.435 --> 00:03:52.687
I could look at it,

00:03:52.687 --> 00:03:56.482
but I didn't really
trust myself to interpret it.

00:03:56.482 --> 00:03:58.985
So I went to the thing I did know,

00:03:59.026 --> 00:04:00.152
which is MTV.